{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-weight-decomposition-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proof","doco:Section"],"label":"prf:weight-decomposition-exists","kind":"proof","title":"Proof of existence of the weight decomposition","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/thm-weight-decomposition-exists"],"text":"weight-decomposition-exists-proof.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prf:weight-decomposition-exists\"></a><p>The projections are constructed from the torus averaging operator: for\neach weight <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda</code> of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T</code>-action, the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda</code>-isotypic\nprojector <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e_\\lambda</code> is idempotent, and\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\pi_H = e_0</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\pi_V = \\mathrm{id} - e_0</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition-exists-proof.md","heading":"Proof"}
